        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "-: Let's talk about the archetypes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "Now, as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "basically you can create your own templates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 11.4,
          "en": "or you can use some existing templates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.4,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "So let's say if you want to build a spring project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 16.71,
          "en": "or any framework project where you have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.71,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "a lot of configuration by yourself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "But what if you think, \"Hey, you know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 22.47,
          "en": "in this world there are so many developers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.47,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "they might have worked on some framework.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "So what if I can get those configuration by default?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "So, of course, you will not get everything in the world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "but there are certain famous templates which are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 35.88,
          "en": "that are available with Maven.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.88,
          "end": 38.46,
          "en": "We can use them or you can create your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 41.55,
          "en": "So these templates are basically called archetypes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "Okay, now how we are going to use it, it's very simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "You can create your own archetype,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 48.24,
          "en": "or let's say, let me create a new Project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.24,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "So let's say if you click here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 52.38,
          "en": "when you go for the new project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 52.38,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "you can see there's an option of Maven Archetypes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 57.57,
          "en": "So basically you can use some existing archetypes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "and you can name, give a name here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 60.72,
          "en": "maybe we will say DemoSpringProject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "Of course we're not going to build Spring project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "but let's say if I'm working with Spring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
